.page history 1 list the commands typed so far

# SYNOPSIS
*history*

# DESCRIPTION
`history` is a gapsh builtin that prints the numbered command history of the interactive session. The Up and Down keys and ^R search it. At most 1000 lines are kept; the last 500 are saved in `~/.gapsh_history` when the shell exits.

# SEE ALSO
gapsh(1)
